# This file is for reference only. The MCP server runs with zero configuration.
#
# All values below are built into the server as defaults. Leo-related tools
# (execute, deploy, compile, test, decrypt_record) accept privateKey and
# projectPath as tool arguments — no env vars needed.
#
# ALEO_NETWORK=testnet
# ALEO_ENDPOINT=https://api.explorer.provable.com/v1
# PAYROLL_PROGRAM=payroll_private_v2.aleo
# MOCK_TOKEN_PROGRAM=mock_token.aleo
